<title>USA: United Healthcare Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>United Healthcare Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net			 84,039		   93,670</p>
