<p> Revs		   7,397,651		3,477,316</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 185,030		  176,615</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is United Healthcare Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: Net earnings for first nine months 1996 include non-operating merger costs associated with acquisition of HealthWise of America Inc of $14.9 million or $0.05 per share, and the provision for future losses on two multi-year contracts of $45 million or $0.15 per common share.</p>
